  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 Syria Regional Appeal - Lebanon - Education in Emergencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, UNRWA will continue to provide educational services to 38,377 Palestine refugee students. The 2024 EA will respond to the needs triggered by the Ein
El Hilweh crisis of July&#x2013;September 2023, which deprived children of their right to safe access to education and resulted in the displacement of 5,900 students who normally attend eight UNRWA schools in the camp. These schools were damaged during the clashes and the children were relocated to five schools outside of the camp, which will operate on double-shifts to cope with the new influx of students during the 2023/24 school year.</narrative>
  </description>
